WEBVTT

00:00:29.484 --> 00:00:33.404
I’ve been sent here to talk 
to you about puberty.

00:00:33.905 --> 00:00:35.198
Any questions?

00:00:37.575 --> 00:00:42.413
During puberty, your reproductive organs
grow and mature.

00:00:42.789 --> 00:00:43.956
Any questions?

00:00:45.917 --> 00:00:52.632
This ripening allows you to become
a sexually mature adult.

00:00:55.093 --> 00:00:58.137
There are so many other changes 
to your body

00:00:58.346 --> 00:01:01.766
that puberty can seem almost magical.